acadrust (built-in DWG reading and writing)
==============================================================================

AfroBIM's built-in DWG reader and writer (crates/afrobim-dwg) use the acadrust library,
version 0.6.8, by Hakan AK and its contributors.

    Licence: Mozilla Public License, version 2.0 (MPL-2.0)
    Source:  https://github.com/hakanaktt/acadrust
             https://crates.io/crates/acadrust/0.6.8
